# English-only code

- Write source code in **English**: variable names, functions, types, file names, comments, and commit messages.
- Name React components in **English** PascalCase (`SignIn`, `ProjectsBoard`), never mixed-language names.
- Default **fallback** UI strings and `aria-label` text in English; hosts pass localized labels via props (no i18n message catalogs in this package).
